                                                "sense_id": "606971bb-a07b-3807-b1f1-036d073861d4",
                                                "text": "I paused to say, “Good,” then returned to breathing and vocalizing while I repeatedly bent over, stretched, and rolled up slowly, warming up my spine—and ignoring the way the wires of my push-up corset poked and squeezed me."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "817cc3fd-7bbc-4b1b-b323-6a82e7e63195",
                                                "sense_id": "606971bb-a07b-3807-b1f1-036d073861d4",
                                                "text": "In the sharper light of his hotel room, the woman's skin looked overpowdered; her bra was push-up, a pendant nestled in the cleavage."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e5e32165-50b3-35c7-bba6-547a2845c51d",
                                        "entry_id": "89ce71ea-1cb4-3208-9d47-b65f061fd0e3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Designed to be worn rolled up."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f8a5d541-4aed-464d-a149-038779a19238",
                                                "sense_id": "e5e32165-50b3-35c7-bba6-547a2845c51d",
                                                "text": "Season's most popular blouses feature push-up sleeves, little- boy collars, dainty ties."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "14f52746-b5a0-40e4-89f3-7df723273da1",
                                                "sense_id": "e5e32165-50b3-35c7-bba6-547a2845c51d",
                                                "text": "These intriguing outfits feature harem pants with long draped front-panel belts, slinky, sleeveless coats, flowing dresses that cling, trousers with push-up legs and deep-cut pants that reveal a whole lot of slim, smooth belly- button and all!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5908c04d-31e6-44db-afb0-43621339fb86",
                                                "sense_id": "e5e32165-50b3-35c7-bba6-547a2845c51d",
                                                "text": "A lovely body-skimming blouson with flattering full sleeves and wide push-up cuffs."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "push-up",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "93850a3e-164d-35bf-83bc-5b4dabd63c7d",
                                        "entry_id": "f39833c5-0df4-3ada-afd7-d543e263483d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An exercise done to improve upper body strength, performed by resting on one's toes and hands and pushing one's weight off the floor."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4cacf50f-d47b-4a73-9e6f-be4596ccbb20",
                                                "sense_id": "93850a3e-164d-35bf-83bc-5b4dabd63c7d",
                                                "text": "2008, Lou Schuler, \"Foreward\", in Nate Green, Built for Show, page xii\nI did lots of push-ups and pull-ups, and my only regret is that I stopped doing them as a young adult when I finally got to work out in health clubs instead of my basement or garage."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4df0d20f-e832-3806-95d8-d972873a91d0",
                                        "entry_id": "f39833c5-0df4-3ada-afd7-d543e263483d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A push-up bra."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "637c1a7c-3b87-4056-b713-25e943e4969b",
                                                "sense_id": "4df0d20f-e832-3806-95d8-d972873a91d0",
                                                "text": "Push-ups give girls with smaller breasts an extra bit of lift and shape."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "push-up",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e8699355-cffc-31be-bd44-2e6ac4607365",
                                        "entry_id": "350362d7-db32-3158-843d-abe906f8077e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To perform a push-up, or to lift oneself off the ground in a push-up–like manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "35ba39f3-0800-4824-ab75-5709a0fa73bf",
                                                "sense_id": "e8699355-cffc-31be-bd44-2e6ac4607365",
                                                "text": "Jenk kept off to the side, but joined the class as they started their push-ups.[…] Jenk push-upped, eyes on the ground."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
